  "adapter_notes": [
    "Adapter uses the low-level AlignAtt decoder with the already-loaded CTranslate2 encoder; the broad WLK server/backend is not imported.",
    "Commit split correction: export only token groups included in the committed hypothesis; hold last word/Unicode unit until more audio or final flush.",
    "Auto language identification runs before first commit; no initial language-less hypotheses are translated.",
    "No text-only repetition-loop removal or DRY penalty: real repeated speech remains repeatable.",
    "CT2 features are converted to the decoder weight dtype; decoder uses CUDA fp16 and known official turbo/large-v3 alignment heads.",
    "Windows without Triton uses the upstream Torch median-filter fallback; numba and tiktoken are required.",
    "Returned attention timestamps include upstream estimated final-token duration; adapter constrains metadata to received audio.",
    "ASR API errors propagate; upstream wrapper behavior that turns exceptions into empty output is not used."
  ],
